{
 "mode": "built-in image_gen",
 "common": "Use case: ui-mockup.\nAsset type: polished desktop web application UI design example for Super Planer, a Korean AI game-planning tool.\nCreate ONE complete desktop screen, wide 16:10 composition around 1920x1200, flat straight-on screenshot, edge-to-edge product UI, no monitor/device mockup, no perspective, no external labels.\nVisual system: shadcn/ui light theme, restrained professional product design. White surfaces, zinc-50 background, zinc-900 text, zinc-500 secondary text, zinc-200 1px borders, 8-12px corner radii, subtle shadows, 8px spacing system, clean Lucide-like line icons. Brand primary indigo #4F46E5 sampled from supplied exact logo. Readable Korean typography like Pretendard/Noto Sans KR, precise hierarchy, calm whitespace. No decorative gradients or giant illustrations. Logo text MUST read Super Planer (one n), preserve the supplied original S-shaped workflow icon and wordmark.\nUse the SAME example project throughout this UI set: \"달빛 우체국\", a cozy game delivering letters in a small forest village. All visible UI text Korean, except exact logo and conventional shortcuts/AI.\nReference inputs: first supplied image is the original logo rasterized from the user's SVG, preserve its identity. Sketch images supply information hierarchy only, replace hand drawing with finished shadcn-style UI. Do not draw orange numbered annotations.\n",
 "screens": [
  {
   "id": "01-prompt-entry",
   "refs": [
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/drafts/.references/super-planer-logo.png",
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/design/1.png"
   ],
   "prompt": "Screen 1: idea entry. Follow sketch 1: big centered original logo above a large prompt composer. This is the empty start of a real app inspired by prompt-first v0 / Lovable / Replit UX. At top left a small \"워크스페이스\" breadcrumb; top right small \"내 프로젝트\" ghost button and circular J avatar. Center content width roughly 760px with abundant empty space. Logo around 250px wide at y=250. Heading below \"어떤 게임을 만들고 싶나요?\" then subtitle \"떠오른 아이디어를 적어주세요. 질문을 나누며 기획을 구체화해요.\" Main textarea white bordered card, 760x190, visible example typed prompt \"작은 숲속 마을에서 편지를 배달하는\\n따뜻한 힐링 게임을 만들고 싶어.\" Bottom inside composer: paperclip icon \"참고 자료\" on left, right indigo submit button with up arrow and label \"기획 시작\". Below show tiny Enter-key hint and three compact outline inspiration chips \"힐링 시뮬레이션\", \"스토리 어드벤처\", \"캐주얼 퍼즐\". Near bottom quiet three-step progress \"01 아이디어 → 02 질문과 답변 → 03 기획 완성\". Clean product screenshot, excellent central composition."
  },
  {
   "id": "02-guided-questions",
   "refs": [
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/drafts/.references/super-planer-logo.png",
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/design/2.png",
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/drafts/01-prompt-entry.png"
   ],
   "prompt": "Screen 2: guided Socratic questions after entering prompt. Follow sketch 2 with centered original logo and vertical stack of prompt summary then question component. Top minimal app bar same as entry, back \"이전으로\" left, avatar J right. Main content centered width 800px. Logo smaller around 210px wide near top y=160. Muted compact prompt summary card with icon and text \"작은 숲속 마을에서 편지를 배달하는 힐링 게임\". Beneath: active question card, white shadcn Card, generous padding. Top progress label \"질문 2 / 5\" left, \"플레이 경험\" small badge right, 40% indigo thin progress bar. Heading \"플레이어가 어떤 기분을 느끼면 좋을까요?\" supporting sentence \"가장 가까운 답을 고르거나, 직접 적어주세요.\" Three full-width radio answer cards, each with outline icon, title and short description: \"편안한 휴식\" selected with indigo border/pale indigo background and checked radio, \"이야기 속 몰입\", \"작은 성취의 즐거움\". Below a labeled text input \"직접 입력\" with placeholder \"원하는 경험을 자유롭게 적어주세요\". Bottom previous outline button and indigo \"다음 질문\" button. Small helper below \"정답은 없어요. 나중에 언제든 바꿀 수 있어요.\" All content readable, no sidebar yet, thoughtful and calm.\nAdditional reference: third image is the already approved first screen in this same UI set; match its typography, border treatment, indigo buttons and overall light theme."
  },
  {
   "id": "03-workflow-canvas",
   "refs": [
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/drafts/.references/super-planer-logo.png",
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/design/3.png",
    "/Users/jyl/work/repo/ai-agent-live/super-planer/docs/drafts/01-prompt-entry.png"
   ],
   "prompt": "Screen 3: generated project workspace in node workflow view. Follow LEFT panel of sketch 3, using full desktop canvas. Persistent 230px white left sidebar original Super Planer logo at top 170px wide, outline \"+ 새 프로젝트\" button, section \"프로젝트\", selected project \"달빛 우체국\" pale indigo row, another \"숲속 카페\", bottom settings and avatar J. Main top header shows breadcrumb \"프로젝트 / 달빛 우체국\", saved green dot \"저장됨\", outline \"공유\", indigo prominent \"기획서 생성\" button at upper right. Below large project heading \"달빛 우체국\" and pencil icon (project name); description \"숲속 마을에 편지를 전하며 마음을 잇는 힐링 어드벤처\" (project description). Tabs \"워크플로우\" selected and \"기획서\", with progress \"결정 완료 3 / 6\". Main remaining area light gray dotted infinite canvas, n8n-like branching Bezier connections, handles on left/right of node cards. Six or seven deliberately arranged readable planning cards: root \"게임 컨셉\" at left, branches \"핵심 플레이\" top-middle, \"세계관과 스토리\" middle, \"아트 방향\" bottom-middle, right \"성장과 보상\", \"등장인물\". White 220x150 cards with icon, title, 1-2 line description, status Badge. \"게임 컨셉\", \"세계관과 스토리\", \"아트 방향\" status green \"결정 완료\"; \"핵심 플레이\" indigo \"진행 중\" selected indigo outline; \"성장과 보상\", \"등장인물\" gray \"검토 전\". EVERY card has a tiny expand icon in upper right. Include tiny \"대화 4\" and footer \"결정 확정\" / undo icon as appropriate. A small illustrative forest thumbnail in art card is allowed, no huge art.
